big bad evil  thing we're scared right and the duffer  brothers are like yeah  like like you're pretty confident the  levity in the characters is really just  rejuvenating for the actors who if they  were stuck in a place of constant terror  might just find the show not so fun to  film number 15. we're not talking about  vechna's clocks but netflix's they were  cutting it close to time with adding the  final vfx actually their time was so bad  that if you tuned in to watch volume 2  right upon release there were a few vfx  shots that weren't done yet and people  were encouraged not to watch until the  morning when they would be complete did  you binge watch the entire two episodes  of volume 2 let us know in the comments  and thanks for hanging out with us here  at the things
 

